      <description align="center" color="transparent" colored="true" height="247" resized="false" width="180" x="867" y="268">This block calculates tag values using fixed-point iteration, updating them until the delta meets the minimum threshold. Tags are mapped in the RM block concerning the pre_optimizer_iterative_inferred block.&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br&gt;O/P : Current data</description>
      <description align="center" color="red" colored="true" height="656" resized="true" width="402" x="16" y="16">compute iterative tag&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Author:&lt;br&gt;Akshay Hasabe&lt;br&gt;Naveen Kumar&lt;br&gt;Karthik Sanagapalli&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Overview:&lt;br&gt;This block computes tag values using formulas mapped from the RM block to the pre_optimizer_iterative_inferred block. It uses a fixed-point iterative method, updating tag values until changes fall below a defined threshold.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Input:&lt;br/&gt;1: main_data&lt;br&gt;2: tags&lt;br&gt;3: pipeline macros&lt;br&gt;4: tag_Referene_data&lt;br&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Output:&lt;br&gt;1: main_Data&lt;br&gt;2: initial values&lt;br&gt;3: tags&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
